// A dead secret temp is removed. A live one stays.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE sweep ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE law   ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG sweep law

IMPULSE sweep 1
IMPULSE law 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY law
DECIDE law
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "sweep" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
